title: $:/config/forms/fold-map
type: application/json

{
"documentation": "This map is empty by default: which letters fold to what is language configuration, not engine mechanism. See [[$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/forms/fold.js]] for how folding works, and [[$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/forms/readme]] for the engine overview. A configuration layer overrides this tiddler, at a higher `plugin-priority`, with the letters its language needs."
